            "review_title": "Review at Mi Van Than Sui Cao",
            "review_text": "emmanuel D\nEnghien Les Bains, France97 contributions\n0\nA typical Vietnamese cuisine restaurant or freshness and flavor will make you come back\nFeb 2025 • Family\nTypical Vestamese streetfood restaurant \nThe dishes served are fresh, cooked in front of you in a kitchen where you can admire the flame of \"fried rice\".\nFresh and fried nems are excellent. The soups (about twenty) with noodles or legs will delight. Squid and shrimp fried rice are to be tested.\n3 types of beer including Hanoi Beer are in the spotlight.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten February 18, 2025",
