            "review_text": "Darren C\nThornlands, Australia28 contributions\n0\nUnderstated and value for money\nSep 2024 • Couples\nAgain in Hanoi and stumbled across this place on Hang Bong Rd. Idea place for a snack or light meal while people and traffic watching. Nothing flash but definitely value for money. Most meals around. $60k dong, spring rolls - $20-40k dong, beers $25k. No taxes or surcharges. (Image - dry noodles and beed -$60k)\nWritten September 3, 2024",
